            from 40, tertiary from 72, optional from 100 - <b>ShowSecondaryText</b> forces the second. <b>CoinSize</b> sets any pixel size,
            scaling the initials and dot with it. <b>HidePersonaDetails</b> leaves the coin alone, named after the person.
